---
source: crates/tungstate-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: help
---
Keep folders in the shape you declared.

Usage: tungstate <COMMAND>

Commands:
  folder      Manage governed folders
  link        Manage transfer links between folders
  connection  Manage connections to places other than this machine
  log         Show everything that ever happened to a path
  whereis     Show where a file ended up
  help        Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
